change-matcher

Code: MIT, see LICENSE.

Model (models/energy-documents/cross-encoder/): ed-minilm-l6-3way, a fine-tune of
cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2 (Apache License 2.0, https://huggingface.co/cross-encoder/ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2),
exported to ONNX and quantised to int8. The tokenizer is the base model's.

Training data included synthetic regulatory documents and paragraphs from CUAD v1, the Contract Understanding Atticus
Dataset by The Atticus Project (CC BY 4.0, https://www.atticusprojectai.org/cuad). The training pairs and the
generator that made them are not part of this repository.
